 449:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
 450:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *       _EncodeStr()
 451:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
 452:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Function description
 453:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Encode a string in variable-length format.
 454:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
 455:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Parameters
 456:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    pPayload - Pointer to where string will be encoded.
 457:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    pText    - String to encode.
 458:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Limit    - Maximum number of characters to encode from string.
 459:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
 460:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Return value
 461:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Pointer to the byte following the value, i.e. the first free
 462:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    byte in the payload and the next position to store payload
 463:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    content.
 464:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
 465:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Additional information
