 698:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Send a SystemView packet over RTT. RTT channel and mode are
 699:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    configured by macros when the SystemView component is initialized.
 700:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    This function takes care of maintaining the packet drop count
