 702:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    The packet must be passed without Id and Length because this
 703:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    function prepends it to the packet before transmission.
 704:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
 705:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Parameters
 706:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    pStartPacket - Pointer to start of packet payload.
 707:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *                   There must be at least 4 bytes free to prepend Id and Length.
 708:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    pEndPacket   - Pointer to end of packet payload.
 709:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    EventId      - Id of the event to send.
 710:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
 711:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** */
