1375:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
1376:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Function description
1377:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Initializes the SYSVIEW module.
1378:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Must be called before the SystemView Application connects to
1379:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    the system.
1380:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
1381:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Parameters
1382:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    SysFreq        - Frequency of timestamp, usually CPU core clock frequency.
1383:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    CPUFreq        - CPU core clock frequency.
1384:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    pOSAPI         - Pointer to the API structure for OS-specific functions.
1385:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    pfSendSysDesc  - Pointer to record system description callback function.
1386:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
1387:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Additional information
1388:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    This function initializes the RTT channel used to transport
1389:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    SEGGER SystemView packets.
1390:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    The channel is assigned the label "SysView" for client software
1391:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    to identify the SystemView channel.
1392:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
1393:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    The channel is configured with the macro SEGGER_SYSVIEW_RTT_CHANNEL.
ARM GAS  /var/folders/yl/_q9l42k90g1g4mdhbs226msm0000gn/T//ccxj18A8.s 			page 74


