1780:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *       SEGGER_SYSVIEW_RecordString()
1781:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
1782:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Function description
1783:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Formats and sends a SystemView packet containing a string.
1784:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
1785:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Parameters
1786:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    EventID - SystemView event ID.
1787:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    pString - The string to be sent in the SystemView packet payload.
1788:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
1789:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Additional information
1790:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    The string is encoded as a count byte followed by the contents
1791:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    of the string.
1792:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    No more than SEGGER_SYSVIEW_MAX_STRING_LEN bytes will be encoded to the payload.
1793:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** */
