1872:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Function description
1873:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Stop recording SystemView events.
1874:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
1875:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    This function is triggered by the SystemView Application on disconnect.
1876:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    For single-shot or postmortem mode recording, it can be called
1877:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    by the application.
1878:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
1879:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Additional information
1880:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    This function disables transmission of SystemView packets recorded
1881:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    by subsequent trace calls.  If transmission is enabled when
1882:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    this function is called, a single SystemView Stop event is recorded
1883:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    to the trace, send, and then trace transmission is halted.
1884:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** */
