2005:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
2006:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Function description
2007:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Send the system description string to the host.
2008:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    The system description is used by the SystemView Application
2009:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    to identify the current application and handle events accordingly.
2010:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
2011:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    The system description is usually called by the system description
2012:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    callback, to ensure it is only sent when the SystemView Application
2013:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    is connected.
2014:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
2015:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Parameters
2016:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    sSysDesc - Pointer to the 0-terminated system description string.
2017:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
2018:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Additional information
2019:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    One system description string may not exceed SEGGER_SYSVIEW_MAX_STRING_LEN characters.
2020:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Multiple description strings can be recorded.
2021:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
2022:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    The Following items can be described in a system description string.
2023:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Each item is identified by its identifier, followed by '=' and the value.
2024:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Items are separated by ','.
2025:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** */
