2473:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** /*********************************************************************
2474:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
2475:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *       SEGGER_SYSVIEW_HeapDefine()
2476:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
2477:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Function description
2478:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Define heap.
2479:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
2480:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Parameters
2481:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    pHeap        - Pointer to heap control structure.
2482:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    pBase        - Pointer to managed heap memory.
2483:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    HeapSize     - Size of managed heap memory in bytes.
2484:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    MetadataSize - Size of metadata associated with each heap allocation.
2485:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
2486:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Additional information
2487:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    SystemView can track allocations across multiple heaps.
2488:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
2489:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    HeapSize must be a multiple of the natural alignment unit of the
2490:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    target.  This size is subject to compression, controlled by the
2491:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    specific setting of SEGGER_SYSVIEW_ID_SHIFT.
2492:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
ARM GAS  /var/folders/yl/_q9l42k90g1g4mdhbs226msm0000gn/T//ccxj18A8.s 			page 206


2493:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    MetadataSize defines the size of the per-allocation metadata.
2494:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    For many heap implementations, the metadata size is a multiple of
2495:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    the word size of the machine and typically contains the size
2496:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    of the allocated block (used upon deallocation), optional
2497:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    pointers to the preceding and/or following blocks, and optionally
2498:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    a tag identifying the owner of the block.  Note that MetadataSize
2499:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    is not compressed within the SystemView packet and is not
2500:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    required to be a multiple of 1<<SEGGER_SYSVIEW_ID_SHIFT.
2501:./SystemView/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** */
